  <Docs>
    <typeparam name="T">The type of the elements received by the observer.</typeparam>
    <summary>
            Provides a mechanism for receiving push-based asynchronous notifications.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            This interface provides an async-native observer pattern where all notification
            methods return <see cref="T:System.Threading.Tasks.ValueTask" />. Subscription cancellation is handled
            via <see cref="T:System.IAsyncDisposable" /> rather than <see cref="T:System.Threading.CancellationToken" />.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
